12. WORKING OF THE SYSTEM

The working process of the system is as follows:

The application starts through Main.java.
Existing data can be loaded from the text files.
The user is shown the main menu.
The user can display, add, search, or remove vehicles.
Customers can be added and searched.
A customer can rent an available vehicle.
The rental duration is recorded.
The total rental bill is calculated.
The vehicle can be returned after the rental.
Rental history can be viewed.
Updated information can be saved into the text files.
The user can exit the application.
13. HOW TO RUN THE PROJECT

The project can be run using IntelliJ IDEA.

Steps:

Open the project in IntelliJ IDEA.
Make sure all Java classes are present in the same source package/folder.
Run Main.java.
The application will display the main menu.
Select the required option using the menu number.
Use Save Data before closing the application if changes need to be stored.
